---
---

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-4 py-20 text-center">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl" style="color: var(--color-text-primary); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace; line-height: 1.2;">
    AI-first project planning<br class="hidden sm:block"> for developers
  </h1>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--color-text-secondary);">
    Transform raw ideas into structured, execution-ready development plans.
    Local-first. Open source. Zero infrastructure required.
  </p>
  <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
    <a href="/docs/getting-started" class="inline-flex items-center rounded px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-90" style="background: var(--color-accent); border-radius: 3px;">
      Get started
    </a>
    <a href="https://github.com/orchestra/orchestra" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="hero-btn-secondary inline-flex items-center rounded border px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium transition-colors duration-150" style="border-color: var(--color-border-default); color: var(--color-text-secondary); background: transparent; border-radius: 3px;">
      <span class="mr-2">GitHub</span>
      <span class="text-xs" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">↗</span>
    </a>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-lg overflow-hidden rounded border p-4 text-left" style="border-color: var(--color-border-default); background: var(--color-bg-elevated); border-radius: 3px;">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs" style="color: var(--color-text-muted);">
      <span>terminal</span>
      <span style="color: var(--color-border-subtle);">—</span>
      <span>bash</span>
    </div>
    <code class="mt-2 block text-sm" style="color: var(--color-text-primary); font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;">
      <span style="color: var(--color-accent);">$</span> git clone https://github.com/orchestra/orchestra.git<br>
      <span style="color: var(--color-accent);">$</span> cd orchestra && pnpm install<br>
      <span style="color: var(--color-accent);">$</span> pnpm dev
    </code>
  </div>
</section>
